{
  "$Comment": [
    "The Hardcore chase's end-of-run spoils, rolled by the player's score when the round is won.",
    "",
    "Rolls  - what everybody who wins takes home, whatever they scored.",
    "Pool   - the part that varies. Pool.Rolls says how many picks the run earns: three to start,",
    "         plus one more per 2200 points (the weight is 1 divided by 2200), never more than 6.",
    "         Entries compete by Weight and are drawn with replacement, so one can come up twice.",
    "",
    "The best table of the three: the widest baseline, the most picks, and the largest stacks.",
    "The score thresholds are correspondingly higher, so the premium entries stay something to",
    "play for. Another mod can ADD entries by shipping a lootable with",
    "\"ContributesTo\": \"chase_hardcore\"."
  ],
